flowchart LR
    I[RGB image] --> P2[P2 narrow shape stream<br/>stride 4]
    I --> P3[P3 semantic<br/>stride 8]
    P3 --> P4[P4 semantic<br/>stride 16]
    P4 --> P5[P5 semantic<br/>stride 32]
    P3 -. semantic gate .-> P2
    P4 -. semantic gate .-> P2
    P5 -. semantic gate .-> P2
    P2 --> F[Selective P2 to P3 fusion]
    P3 --> F
    P3 --> Q[Coarse objectness / query]
    P4 --> Q
    Q -. top-K ROI .-> R[Sample P2 ROI only]
    P2 -. sparse crop .-> R
    R --> C[Inner fruit vs outer context ring]
    C --> M[Coarse instance mask]
    M --> U[Uncertain boundary points]
    U --> O[Final visible instance mask]
    S[Separator / offset auxiliary] -. training only .-> U
    P2 -. training only .-> S
